Subject: [PATCH] write copy into the uncached pools (MSC_VITA_WRCOPY, default 0): vglSetWriteCopy(mode) selects sceClibMemcpy (0), whole 64 byte NEON stores (1), 128 byte vstm bursts (2) or sceDmacMemcpy for 8 KiB and more (3) for the stream buffer data (glBufferData/SubData) and the four uniform ring copies; vglWriteCopyVariant and vglWriteCopyStats serve the start-up benchmark and the log (source/utils/wrcopy.[ch])

---

