 void vglSetUniformRingMem(int cdram);
+// 0045 (MSC_VITA_WRCOPY): how data is copied INTO the uncached pools (stream buffers, uniform ring): 0 sceClibMemcpy (default), 1 two aligned 32 byte NEON stores per 64 bytes,
